          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Track order",
            "content": "<p>Once your order is confirmed, you will receive an email with your order number. To track your order, simply visit our <a href=\"https://juliasophiecharleston.com/apps/parcelpanel \" title=\"https://juliasophiecharleston.com/apps/parcelpanel \"><em><strong>Order Tracking</strong></em></a> page and enter your order number or email address.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Free premium shipping",
            "content": "<p>We ship all our orders within the VS with UPS. <br/><br/>Place your order before 11:00 AM and we’ll make sure it’s processed the same day.</p><p>Your order will be carefully prepared and shipped as quickly as possible.<br/><br/>Enjoy free shipping on all orders.</p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns",
            "content": "<p>Not quite satisfied? No worries! You can easily and quickly return your order within 30 days of receipt. We make sure the process goes smoothly, so you don't have to worry.</p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Size",
            "content": "<p>Our clothes fit exactly as indicated in the size chart. You will find the size chart with each product, so you can always choose the right size and be sure it fits perfectly.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_i7Uw3z": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Neede more help?",
            "content": "<p>Have a question or need advice? Don’t hesitate to contact us. We are here to assist you and provide expert guidance.<br/><br/>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@juliasophiecharleston.com\" title=\"mailto:info@juliasophiecharleston.com\">info@juliasophiecharleston.com</a><br/></p><p>Mon / Fri 09:00 - 17:00</p><p>Sat / Sun 10:00 - 17:00</p>"
